Package: netra
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, network-manager, bluez, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, iproute2, policykit-1
Description: Unified Linux Control Center for Wi-Fi, Hotspot, Bluetooth, PipeWire Audio and QoS
 Netra provides a modern, visual desktop interface unifying Linux connectivity
 and multimedia subsystems without requiring terminal commands.
 .
 Features:
  * NetworkManager Wi-Fi scanning and hotspot tethering
  * BlueZ 5.x Bluetooth pairing, reconnection, and battery telemetry
  * Linux Traffic Control (tc/HTB) bandwidth QoS prioritizing
  * PipeWire / PulseAudio per-application matrix routing and multi-sink broadcast
  * Sub-second procfs process network telemetry
